			{id=2022,title="Oaf Smash",body="The Lumbering Oaf will periodically grab a player and run to the farthest side of the room from the entrance. The Oaf then quickly runs and smashes into a wooden log on the other side of the room, knocking back and dealing 100 Physical damage to the player.$[!2,4\n\nIn Heroic Difficulty, the impact of Oaf Smash instead inflicts $88300s2% of the target player's health in Physical damage. $]"},
			{id=2023,title="Throw Helix",body="The Lumbering Oaf will take Helix from his back, and throw the goblin onto a random player's face for ten seconds. While Helix is attached, he punches the player with his normal melee attack."},
