			{id=2063,title="Fiery Blaze",body="After Vanessa has been wounded below 50% of her total health, she will leap to the top of the ship and detonate preplaced explosives around the ship. These explosives will create Fiery Blazes across the deck. Players within $93485A1 yards of a fire will be dealt $93485s1 Fire damage every second. \n\nPlayers may avoid the worst of the fires on the deck by using a nearby rope on the side of the deck.",difficultyIDs={2,4,5,6}},
