		instanceID=227,
		order=7,
		name="Twilight Lord Bathiel",
		lore="The Twilight's Hammer do not tolerate failure, so the first command Twilight Lord Bathiel gave once he assumed control of Blackfathom Deeps was to throw Lord Kelris into the hungry maw of Aku'mai.  Now, this elemental ascendant commits the depths of his unfathomable power to raising the beast of the Old Gods and covering the world in black.",
