		instanceID=246,
		order=5,
		name="Darkmaster Gandling",
		lore="Course: Advanced Studies\n\nThe recent defeat in Andorhal has put Darkmaster Gandling in the foulest of moods. More than ever, all students of Scholomance are advised to impress him at every turn. Pupils who dissatisfy the headmaster will be removed from class to perform lab work... or become lab work.",
