		instanceID=234,
		order=5,
		name="Charlga Razorflank",
		lore="The leader (or \"crone\") of the Razorfen tribes is Charlga Razorflank, a quilboar whose experimental and powerful Geomancy practices are second to none. Her meteoric rise to power and the rapidly increasing violence between quilboar tribesmen can only lead to one thing: war.",
