	[2667]={
		encounterID=2667,
		instanceID=1301,
		order=5,
		name="The Seven",
		lore="Centuries ago, sorcerer-thane Thaurissan and seven of his most powerful Dark Iron allies accidentally summoned Ragnaros into Azeroth and damned their entire clan to enslavement. Although the Seven perished during the ritual, their restless spirits still linger in Blackrock Depths, cursed to serve their elemental master and the current Dark Iron ruler.",
		dungeonEncounterID=3048,
		uiMapID=2362,
		pin={x=0.5383,y=0.248},
		difficultyIDs={14,15,17},
		npcIDs={226307,226308,226309,226310,226311,226312,226313},
		displayIDs={122580,122581,122582,122583,122584,122585,122586},
		loot={
			{itemID=231430,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=231434,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=231432,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=231474,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=231473,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=231427,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=231428,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=231476,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=231475,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=231431,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=30762,title="Overview",body="The Seven alternate between manifesting fully in the physical realm and returning to their ghostly state becoming |cFF2959D3|Hspell:464371|h[Corporeal]|h|r or |cFF2959D3|Hspell:464370|h[Incorporeal]|h|r. While |cFF2959D3|Hspell:464371|h[Corporeal]|h|r, each member of the Seven inflicts and suffers full damage and has access to more powerful abilities. Anger'rel and Gloom'rel will remain |cFF2959D3|Hspell:464371|h[Corporeal]|h|r through the entire encounter while the third |cFF2959D3|Hspell:464371|h[Corporeal]|h|r member of the Seven changes as the encounter progresses. When a member of the Seven reaches full energy, they will use their most powerful ability."},
			{id=30763,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; Gloom'rel and Anger'rel will remain |cFF2959D3|Hspell:464371|h[Corporeal]|h|r through the entire encounter.\n$bullet; Anger'rel will charge a distant player and use |cFF2959D3|Hspell:465652|h[Bladestorm]|h|r when he reaches full energy.\n$bullet; Gloom'rel will use |cFF2959D3|Hspell:464361|h[Recklessness]|h|r when he reaches full energy.\n$bullet; Each of the Seven have a deadly ultimate ability they will use when they reach maximum energy. The entire raid must respond to these moments in order to defeat the Seven."},
			{id=30764,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; Three of the Seven will be |cFF2959D3|Hspell:464371|h[Corporeal]|h|r at a time and suffer full damage.\n$bullet; Seeth'rel's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:464337|h[Blizzard]|h|r creates a deadly hazard targeting a random player.\n$bullet; Vile'rel's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:464344|h[Power Word: Respite]|h|r creates an absorb that heals its target while it persists.\n$bullet; Each of the Seven have a deadly ultimate ability they will use when they reach maximum energy. The entire raid must respond to these moments in order to defeat the Seven."},
			{id=30765,title="Healers",body="$bullet; Doom'rel will |cFF2959D3|Hspell:464333|h[Banish]|h|r a random player when he is |cFF2959D3|Hspell:464371|h[Corporeal]|h|r.\n$bullet; Dope'rel's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:469628|h[Smoke Bomb]|h|r will reduce spell range while it persists.\n$bullet; Hate'rel's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:464362|h[Magma Burn]|h|r will become deadly if it stacks too high.\n$bullet; Each of the Seven have a deadly ultimate ability they will use when they reach maximum energy. The entire raid must respond to these moments in order to defeat the Seven."},
			{id=30766,title="Anger'rel"},
			{id=30800,title="Section 12"},
			{id=30801,title="Section 12"},
			{id=30802,title="Section 12"},
			{id=30769,title="Gloom'rel"},
